WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.000
On a screen, the trainer overlays a map of the ancient Jezero delta on the profile of the Gran Arenal. In one corner, the Perseverance vehicle appears. A thirty-kilogram load keeps the same mass in both worlds. On Mars, it weighs about thirty-eight percent of what it weighs here. You will train to climb through volcanic ash, extract a rock core, and calibrate cameras in a landscape with very few visual references.
